WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:02.430
we have a voicemail number.

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:04.830
That number is 2 1 9 to David P..

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:09.110
This voicemail caller asks the question I
asked on Twitter a few days ago, what if the

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:13.630
armed corona virus protesters were groups
of black people?

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:15.660
Would it be different how they were handled?

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:17.919
Take a listen to the voice mail question.

00:00:17.919 --> 00:00:19.570
Hi, David.

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:27.210
My question is, when protesters are blocking
our entrances, harassing nurses and bringing

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:29.519
rifles on state capitol grounds.

00:00:29.519 --> 00:00:30.970
Where are the police?

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:31.970
Right.

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:38.550
If black people or any other group did the
same exact same carrying guns, the police

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:41.500
would be there in riot gear.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:47.930
Arresting people, but if you carry an American
flag in your flight, you can walk any place

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:50.100
you want with a rifle.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.460
That's my question.

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:52.460
Thanks.

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:55.630
Yeah, I am presenting the question without
comment.

00:00:55.630 --> 00:00:57.120
Check out my tweet about it.

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:59.090
See what the reactions were.

00:00:59.090 --> 00:01:00.430
And I want to hear from you.

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:07.670
What if, indeed, the lion's share of the lockdown,
protesters showing up with long guns?

00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:11.009
And I think some of them even like bulletproof
vests.

00:01:11.009 --> 00:01:12.670
What if they were mostly black folks?

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:14.490
How would this this be covered in media?

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:15.490
How would police react?

00:01:15.490 --> 00:01:16.649
Let me know what you think.

